meta {
  name: 48 switch model
  type: http
  seq: 48
}

put {
  url: {{host}}/_cluster/settings
  body: json
  auth: inherit
}

body:json {
  {
    "transient": {
      "nlsearch.model": "llama3.2:3b"
    }
  }
}

docs {
  Settings - switch model

  Takes effect on the next request, no restart. Provider, model, url, api_key, timeout and analysis_ttl can all be changed this way.

  llama3.2:3b is a 3B model and a fair look at the lower limit: it answers single questions but loses the thread on follow-ups.
}
